  <h2 id="next-step">What to do next</h2>

  <p>
    Pick one route, finish one project and show it to two people in the field. Then read ten live notices and apply or pitch a small client.
  </p>
  <p>
    A specialist can look at your strengths, finances and goals with you. A sensible first step is <a href="/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/student-career-guidance/">student career guidance</a>. The aim is a high-income skill portfolio and an earlier path to financial freedom.
  </p>

  <p>
    For ten questions and a scoring table, read <a href="/blog/career-guidance/questions-to-ask-yourself-before-choosing-a-career-india/">questions before choosing a career</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
    For a free values and skills worksheet, read <a href="/blog/skills/work-values-and-skills-inventory-for-career-choice-free-india/">work values and skills inventory</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
    For a ninety-minute session plan and speaker brief, read <a href="/blog/career-guidance/how-to-run-a-career-guidance-session-or-seminar-for-students-india/">running a career guidance session</a>.
